<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσύμ-βολος</span></b> , old 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐξ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to
			divine</i> or <i>understand</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐξ. τόδ᾽ ἐστὶ παντὶ δοξάσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				40.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>easy to deal with, honest, upright</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐξ. δίκαι</span> suits
				<i>which afford easy arbitration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				701
			</span></i> (lyr.). Adv.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐξυμβόλως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					5.139
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>readily contributing one's</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμβολή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				74
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>affording a good omen, auspicious</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.25
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λως</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				6(5).67
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
